{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "6546aad1861fbd2d8802a7141ebbe1e2498e2525636ddb19c44e29fa01ef68f1", "ja": "いいなぁ、ひとりっ子！　うちは弟がいるんだけど、\nすっごくヤンチャで……。", "zh": "真好啊，独生子！我家有个弟弟，\n超级调皮的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "ad30e4b407d437e7e208c8b63e7b06e4a2dd32262caa7c4f3e0c0448fdc2a521", "ja": "わ、私は、兄弟とか姉妹とか、憧れますけど……。\n昴ちゃんは兄弟、多いんだよね？", "zh": "我、我很憧憬有兄弟姐妹什么的……  \n昴有很多兄弟，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "e8177d67a623dd9aa1cdaa535846484d5f5ea57ca61ca11abaa74c7859db351a", "ja": "うん、兄ちゃんばっか、4人もいるよ。\nメチャクチャ騒がしいぜ。", "zh": "嗯，哥哥就有4个呢。\n吵得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "977e5c307e0d06cc6e32c30ab03cdfec0686fb0477d622f14c82c96a1b9446a0", "ja": "でも、女の子が昴ちゃんだけなんだし、\n大事にされてるんじゃない？", "zh": "不过，女孩子就只有昴一个，不是被大家好好珍惜着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "9aba59b6c4c441e4e4cb3d861696c57f785f389cfe48c9aecbefc2e9bb049d9a", "ja": "大事にされてる……のかぁ？　うーん、まぁ……。\nって、オレの話はいいだろ～。", "zh": "很受宠……吗？唔——，还好吧……\n不对，别提我啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1005_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1006_p", "source_sha256": "86bc803eacedbf59f0e01b2e6367ee0795bae655ae653b620e5c448d175c820a", "ja": "おーい、可憐、紗代子、昴！　お待たせ。\n次回公演のメンバー、これで全員だな。", "zh": "喂——可怜、纱代子、昴！让你们久等了。\n下次公演的成员，这样就全员到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "39d5e00fdb19bb11601700cb33c51ea9a6fc3b72e5658f134e5215fdd0e9ceec", "ja": "あ、星梨花ちゃん、貴音さん。それに、\n{$P$}さんも……お疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，星梨花、贵音。还有，{$P$}先生也……辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b6afb6d70c89c95b32176d09c0855f2490745bc0aa01b47fb168033f8faccb2", "ja": "みなさん、おはようございます！\nなんの話をされていたんですか？", "zh": "大家，早上好！\n你们在聊些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "57b815dad9f8787278efa6ce3a8f772585bd7d79451f557f2566a541110369cf", "ja": "今、家族とか兄弟の話をしてたんです。\n確か、星梨花ちゃんもひとりっ子なんだよね？", "zh": "刚才正在聊家人和兄弟姐妹的话题。\n我记得，星梨花也是独生女吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "32829a7aff340e1a877bd0ba105824ad22ad3049bb10503be7d24d3f78db95ec", "ja": "じゃあ、星梨花も可憐んちと一緒で、\n父さん母さんが心配性だったりするのか？", "zh": "那么，星梨花也和可怜家一样，爸爸妈妈都很爱操心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "f462808714a6a0c8a038bea2b8de1cc16f5887865b6f342b564dcf2f11d86b6f", "ja": "確かに、パパはすごく心配性かもしれませんね……。\nでもそれは、大事にしてくれているからだと思います！", "zh": "确实，爸爸可能真的很爱操心呢……。\n不过我觉得，那是因为他很在乎我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "bb6310e6f2e1415214972fe7fd3630ca935e45a637c1aa1edbaafe7f0a7c736a", "ja": "う、うん、そうだよね……。\nあ、あの、貴音さんは、ご兄弟って……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯，也是呢……\n那、那个，贵音小姐有兄弟姐妹吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "570a2a0e4eaccc500705a5da47b8ee245323db5d68c43e1e6f9c784a1f1c6dd8", "ja": "妹がひとり、今も故郷に住んでいますよ。\n永らく、会えてはいませんが。", "zh": "我有一个妹妹，现在也住在故乡。\n只是已经很久没见到她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "239f9463c96a8e3c42f907849c02f01c43d16331d83729606468e04729fd449c", "ja": "ただ、私の家庭事情は少々複雑ですので……。\nこれ以上はとっぷしーくれっと、でお願いします。", "zh": "不过，我的家庭情况稍微有些复杂……。\n接下来的内容，就请当作最高机密吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e2e806413b41b7be09eea5aeba689a65732ecc04432e4751e56c5e228b3256d6", "ja": "兄弟、家族……か。そういえば可憐、\n今度の公演にご両親を呼びたいって言ってたっけ。", "zh": "兄弟、家人……吗。说起来，可怜之前是不是说过，想邀请父母来看下次的公演来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "60bbb0856b278819ed1486c4a050a3a209591dc9ac6b5d1a8d639a219452cadc", "ja": "は、はい！　わ、私の新曲もありますし……。\nせ、成長したところを、見てほしくて……！", "zh": "是、是的！还有我的新歌……我、我想让他们看看我成长的样子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "93d6726089ae92abc998b7ab37c6b6bcfd05ac19900a63f8366d76be05c8f9f7", "ja": "そうだったんだ。気合い充分だね！\nそういうことなら、私達もしっかりサポートしないと！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。干劲十足呢！\n既然如此，我们也得好好支持你才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "328bb95700a1d67ac47f3e3cc347d8cd781ca423bb4b581a4621defad94c5656", "ja": "よーし、なら円陣組んどこうぜ♪\nほらほらみんな、真ん中に集まれーっ！", "zh": "好——勒，那我们来围成圆阵吧♪\n快来快来大家，往中间集合啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0ccc3bf34449aa0f62977ed7473c47217e41ed49ce346836afa0f29b3037911b", "ja": "っと……その前に話があるんだ。\nみんな、『アイグラ！！』っていう雑誌があるよな？", "zh": "等等……在那之前，我有件事要说。\n大家都知道有本叫《偶像写真！！》的杂志吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "77981ef41802b10481067bd2848f402cc4c5f34813b4233a105eb09c4ec95c86", "ja": "アイドルの、グラビア雑誌ですよね？\nわたしも撮ってもらいました！", "zh": "是关于偶像的写真杂志吧？\n我也拍过照片呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7fb3f62c03a3503fbd106dc5dab69fccfd76ee8b678ee24757932313a68a9e43", "ja": "うん、その『アイグラ！！』から、次の公演の\n特集記事を組みたいってオファーが来てるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，那本《偶像写真！！》发来了邀约，\n说想做一期下次公演的特辑报道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "7a74131bb4f18ba9e95f35861ea6fbc0a53e60aac4a11c341674bdc5af1d9e85", "ja": "特集！　凄いじゃないですか！", "zh": "专题报道！那不是很厉害吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9b8ea67e64f48fe36d4bb29d4456a1f64cff8553f9b7ad647512b7ce8bfb7091", "ja": "まあ、すごくありがたいんだけど……。\n準備期間中も、密着取材したいそうなんだ。", "zh": "虽然确实让人非常感激……\n不过对方似乎想在筹备期间也进行贴身跟拍采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8c5b46ed185d3eabdc0a3763e23f6a7b155e19319b0f789448239dc935e26add", "ja": "それだとレッスンに集中できないかもしれないし、\nちょっと悩んでるんだよな……。", "zh": "那样的话，可能没法专心训练，我有点拿不定主意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "9b32b1f3711585fc3bc226ecffd1b206c6f4c067f68a0a2f4d7e72df464338a2", "ja": "私……そ、そのお話……う、受けますっ！！", "zh": "我……那、那个工作……我、我接了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "5b2d0b92bf6793980c2940c646fa4696408eaa8549c8ca269a25e44170a60bc7", "ja": "可憐……！？", "zh": "可怜……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "5a6ab4691562de9b72690e5d2ba75649f951b8ec7675457565fa3097935d45d7", "ja": "あ、ええと……りょ、両親が、取材記事も見てくれ\nたら、成長したって思ってもらえるかも、って……。", "zh": "啊，那个……如、如果父母也能看到采访报道，说不定就会觉得我成长了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "9ff4584f36bef159cdc5f1da2dccc7906b5cb25681a8dd221772c584d9d1c874", "ja": "でも、私ひとりで受ける取材じゃないから……。\nみ、みんなさえよければ、だけど……。", "zh": "不过，这不是我一个人接受的采访……只要大家没意见的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "5cf8dd5b1e21dec76186d4861539ecfa54243dc8c779ead9f396b37cafbd0ee8", "ja": "へへっ、いいに決まってるじゃん！　家族にいいトコ\n見せたいもんな。気持ち、すっげーわかるよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，当然没问题啦！我也想让家人看看自己出色的一面嘛。你的心情，我特别能理解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "cd15d246771bfcea152b4add2dbb6445a49ca8eccd0123edd72e47e9864d82a9", "ja": "わたしも、わかります！　ご両親に、\n頑張っているところ、たくさん見てもらいましょう！", "zh": "我也很明白！就让爸爸妈妈\n好好看看你努力的样子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3c83b5a0cf6f88c529c4d4d0fdb4609bb42cc6999aa5a61070a7127c0469611b", "ja": "うーん……可憐、本当にいいのか？\nずっと密着されて、気が休まらないかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "嗯……可怜，你真的没问题吗？一直被贴身跟拍，可能会让你没法好好放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "74fbb743a4cbf471e91be5c09c97704d631f2c0d841598f2a7b93689dea3b84d", "ja": "う……えっと……。そ、それは……。\nう、ううん。私、頑張ります……頑張りたいです！", "zh": "唔……那个……这、这个嘛……\n没、没事的。我会努力的……我想努力去试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1033_p", "source_sha256": "dbcafb2071e175e0361e46b80903e0a78241a2f6055ed4fd79863a9a5b4bab0a", "ja": "よし、わかった！　先方にはさっそく連絡しておくよ。\n取材も公演も、できるだけいいものにしような！", "zh": "好，明白了！我马上联系对方。\n无论是采访还是公演，都尽量做到最好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_087_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
